{%- comment -%}
  About Page Template
  Converted from app/about/page.tsx
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="min-h-screen bg-black py-12 sm:py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="container">
    {%- comment -%} Page Header {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="section-header mb-12 sm:mb-16 md:mb-20">
      <h1 class="display-heading mb-4 text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-6xl">About Big Butt Association</h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg px-4">
        Meet the crew behind the bootylicious brand and discover our festival-fueled story.
      </p>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Two Column Layout: Bekky & Jarred {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="mb-16 sm:mb-24 md:mb-32">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 sm:gap-12 px-4">
        {%- comment -%} Column 1: Bekky Text + Jarred Picture {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="space-y-8 sm:space-y-12">
          {%- comment -%} Bekky Text {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <h2 class="neon-text-purple text-4xl mb-6 font-heading">Meet Bekky</h2>
            <h3 class="neon-text-gold text-2xl mb-6 font-heading">The Alpaca Queen with the Big Butt</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed text-lg">
              Bekky isn't just our mascot—she's the vibe, the energy, the whole damn party. 
              With her fuzzy purple fur and gold chain that says "BBA," Bekky represents everything 
              we stand for: confidence, celebration, and never taking life too seriously.
            </p>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed text-lg">
              Born from the bass-heavy beats of underground raves and the freedom of festival culture, 
              Bekky reminds us all to embrace who we are, shake what we got, and live every moment to the fullest.
            </p>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed text-lg">
              Join Bekky's crew, rock the merch, and let's make every festival a statement. 🦙👑
            </p>
          </div>
          
          {%- comment -%} Jarred Picture {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="flex justify-center">
            <div class="w-full max-w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-bekky-gray-dark rounded-2xl border-2 border-bekky-gold-neon shadow-neon-gold-md flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-8xl">👤</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        {%- comment -%} Column 2: Bekky Picture + Jarred Text {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="space-y-8 sm:space-y-12">
          {%- comment -%} Bekky Picture {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="flex justify-center">
            <img
              src="{{ 'bekky-no-background.png' | asset_url }}"
              alt="Bekky the Purple Alpaca Queen - Big Butt Association Mascot Character"
              width="400"
              height="400"
              class="w-full max-w-[400px] h-auto rounded-2xl border-2 border-bekky-purple-neon shadow-neon-purple-md glow-on-hover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          
          {%- comment -%} Jarred Text {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <h2 class="neon-text-gold text-4xl mb-6 font-heading">Jarred</h2>
            <h3 class="neon-text-purple text-2xl mb-6 font-heading">The Hostest with the Mostest</h3>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed text-lg">
              Jarred is the mastermind behind the Big Butt Association, bringing the energy, the vision, 
              and the absolute best vibes to every event. Known as "The Hostest with the Mostest," 
              Jarred knows how to throw a party and create unforgettable festival experiences.
            </p>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed text-lg">
              With a passion for EDM culture, community building, and making sure everyone feels welcome, 
              Jarred has built BBA into more than just a brand—it's a movement. From curating the perfect 
              festival lineup to designing gear that makes you stand out, Jarred brings the magic.
            </p>
            <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed text-lg">
              When you're at a BBA event, you're not just attending—you're part of the family. 
              That's the Jarred way. 🎉
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} Big Butt Association Brand Section {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="mb-16 sm:mb-24 md:mb-32 px-4">
      <div class="neon-card max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="neon-text-gold text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-6 sm:mb-8 font-heading text-center">The Big Butt Association</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed text-lg">
            Big Butt Association (BBA) was born from a simple idea: festival culture should be bold, 
            bootylicious, and unapologetically fun. We're not just selling merch—we're building 
            a community of festival-goers who aren't afraid to stand out and shake what they got.
          </p>
          <p class="text-bekky-gray-light leading-relaxed text-lg">
            Our brand represents the intersection of EDM culture, self-expression, and pure celebration. 
            Whether you're headbanging at the rail, shuffling under neon lights, or just vibing with 
            the crew, BBA is here to make sure you look as bold as you feel.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-8">
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🎵</div>
              <h3 class="neon-text-purple text-xl mb-2 font-heading">Festival Culture</h3>
              <p class="text-bekky-gray-light text-sm">
                Rooted in EDM and rave culture, celebrating the music and community
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-4xl mb-4">👑</div>
              <h3 class="neon-text-gold text-xl mb-2 font-heading">Exclusivity</h3>
              <p class="text-bekky-gray-light text-sm">
                Member-only perks, early access, and exclusive drops for the BBA family
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
              <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🦙</div>
              <h3 class="neon-text-purple text-xl mb-2 font-heading">Community</h3>
              <p class="text-bekky-gray-light text-sm">
                Building connections and celebrating together at festivals and events
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} CTA Section {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="mt-16 sm:mt-24 px-4">
      <div class="neon-card-gold max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="neon-text-gold text-3xl mb-4 font-heading">Join the Movement</h2>
        <p class="text-bekky-gray-light mb-6 text-lg">
          Ready to become part of the Big Butt Association? Join BBA Fam and unlock exclusive 
          rewards, early access to drops, and connect with the BBA community!
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a href="/pages/members" class="neon-button-gold neon-button-lg w-full sm:w-auto text-center">
            Join BBA Fam 👑
          </a>
          <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}" class="neon-button neon-button-lg w-full sm:w-auto text-center">
            Shop the Collection
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

